                        <h2 class="text-[28px] font-extrabold tracking-tight">Who we are — Independent, real sources</h2>
                        <p class="mt-4 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600">ScoreUp is an independent educational site. We are <b class="text-slate-900">not a bank, not a credit bureau, and not a financial advisor</b>. We research public data from CFPB, Experian, Equifax, TransUnion and turn it into simple guides.</p>
