                                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-slate-900 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold">SE</div>
                                <div class="text-[13px]"><b class="text-slate-900">ScoreUp Editorial Team</b><br><span class="text-slate-500">Independent researchers • Sources: CFPB, Experian, Equifax, TransUnion • Updated Oct 19, 2026 • Educational only</span></div>
                                <div class="ml-auto hidden md:block px-2 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 text-[10px] font-bold border">VERIFIED SOURCES</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="mt-4 p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border text-[12px] leading-6 text-slate-600"><b>Our methodology:</b> We check CFPB complaint database for hidden fees, verify reporting to 3 bureaus via Experian/Equifax docs, and test approval with $0 history. No product pays for ranking.</div>
                        </div>
