                    <section id="how-we-make-money" class="scroll-mt-24"><div class="inline-flex px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-400 text-slate-900 text-[11px] font-bold tracking-widest">TRANSPARENCY • FTC COMPLIANT</div><h2 class="mt-3 text-[28px] font-extrabold tracking-tight">How We Make Money</h2><p class="mt-4 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600">Free for readers. Two ways, fully disclosed:</p><div class="mt-6 grid gap-4"><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border"><h3 class="font-bold flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-[12px]">1</span> Affiliate Commissions</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[14px] leading-6 text-slate-600">When you apply via our links to Self, Chime, Kikoff, we may earn commission at no extra cost. Links have rel="sponsored".</p></div><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border"><h3 class="font-bold flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-slate-900 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-[12px]">2</span> Display Ads (AdSense)</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[14px] leading-6 text-slate-600">Clearly labeled as Ad. Never influences rankings. Editorial and ads separate.</p></div></div></section>
                    <section id="editorial" class="scroll-mt-24"><h2 class="text-[28px] font-extrabold tracking-tight">Editorial Policy</h2><div class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border overflow-hidden"><div class="grid grid-cols-4 text-[11px] font-bold tracking-widest text-slate-500 bg-slate-50 p-3 border-b"><span class="col-span-2">FACTOR</span><span>WEIGHT</span><span>CHECK</span></div><div class="divide-y divide-slate-100 text-[13px]"><div class="grid grid-cols-4 p-3"><span class="col-span-2 font-semibold">Reporting breadth</span><span>40%</span><span class="text-slate-500">3 bureaus?</span></div><div class="grid grid-cols-4 p-3"><span class="col-span-2 font-semibold">Fees</span><span>25%</span><span class="text-slate-500">CFPB complaints</span></div><div class="grid grid-cols-4 p-3"><span class="col-span-2 font-semibold">Approval odds</span><span>20%</span><span class="text-slate-500">No credit OK?</span></div><div class="grid grid-cols-4 p-3"><span class="col-span-2 font-semibold">Complaints</span><span>15%</span><span class="text-slate-500">Last 12 months</span></div></div></div></section>
                    <section id="disclosure" class="scroll-mt-24"><h2 class="text-[28px] font-extrabold tracking-tight">Ad Disclosure</h2><div class="mt-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 text-[13px]">ScoreUp may receive compensation from partners. This does not affect opinions. Ads labeled as Ad. Educational only.</div><div class="mt-6 flex gap-3"><a href="/" class="h-11 px-6 rounded-full bg-slate-900 text-white font-semibold text-[13px] flex items-center">← Back to Home</a><a href="/Pages/Contact" class="h-11 px-6 rounded-full bg-white border font-semibold text-[13px] flex items-center">Contact →</a></div></section>
